#descr "The Imaskar Empire (also known as the Raurin Empire) was an ancient human nation that ruled lands in the east that came to comprise the nations of Mulhorand, Thay, and Unther. Its citizens were the Imaskari. Imaskari wizards, also known as Artificers, were overwhelmingly powerful and just as haughty. The empire existed from about -8000 DR to -2488 DR, during which time the Imaskari wizards were credited with a number of arcane inventions as well as responsible for numerous cataclysms. The fall of the Imaskari Empire inspired and made way for the rise of the Empire of Netheril. 

In −2488 DR, Lord Ilphemon, along with a small retinue of servants and family, fled the destruction of Imaskar for the Underdark. They would eventually settle in an isolated region at the far edge of the the EarthRoot and founded the city of Deep Imaskar, also known as the City of the Great Seal. There, these refugees survived from -2481 to 1363 DR in complete isolation."
