#descr "The Cities of the Seabreeze was a name given to a series of cities and city-states lying along the southern shore of the Shining Sea, including not only Lapaliiya, but also Thindol, Tashalar, Samarach and Ormpur. The region had a cenuries-long conflict with the Yuan-ti of Serpentes and was at constant threat from  monstrous denizens of the Shaar to the east and Chultan raiders to the west. It was deeply influenced by trade from Calimshan and Halruaa, but remained fiercely independent. 

